  "author" : "^#FF5959;Xan^reset;",
  "description" : "This mod greatly simplifies the Frackin' Universe introduction [i]without[/i] actually getting rid of any vital information. This means that new users [b]still learn everything they need to learn[/b], but are not so overwhelmed with all the radio messages and reading thrown at you as soon as you start.

This is achieved by replacing the tricorder message with a single, short message. Then, the information that was removed from FU's original introduction has been slipped into Vinalisj's dialogue at the start of the tutorial sequence.",
